{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/136230bebeac6ab5b451a3ac7e3c922e.avif?t=1770922479\" width=620 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players strategize through a land of dinosaurs against hordes of enemies and challenging bosses. Your friend can't make it tonight? No worries, they can join you on the next session without getting left behind. Or you can strike out on your own. We get it, not everybody wants to share the glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.poster.avif?t=1770922479\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.webm?t=1770922479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.mp4?t=1770922479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is a short journey where you fight different enemies, stack unique ability combinations and collect bountiful loot to spend in the shop. New characters are recruited with each outing, so even defeat has its upside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.poster.avif?t=1770922479\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.webm?t=1770922479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.mp4?t=1770922479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Starting Classes </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sten is the Old Guard who specializes in positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lady Treelof, a tempestuous Wild Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haben, the Scout setting traps and strikes from a distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian, the unassuming Stray that weaves in and out of combat at will</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&amp; more to unlock!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Multiplayer </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a party with team synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize together against the odds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick sessions that last less than an hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blame your buddy when things go wrong</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Singleplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 2 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control of synergizing and strategizing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go at your own pace,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the glory is yours but so is the blame</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2064310?t=1770922479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2064310?t=1770922479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/acb97f2f55193fadbbc209df2fa5632effa35083/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770922479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st